@title Cabinet: rule and opening flags are in the top-bar count and the Issues rows (1366x768)
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1366x768
# T1 follow-up: the Place-rule and wiring-opening triangles on the plate are counted in the top bar and listed in Issues. Small devices keep their badges apart.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-lesson.novo
wait 30
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
shot plate-badges
check_layout
expect_not "Second use of widget ID"
click_text "error" Button
wait 10
expect "F8 next"
shot issues-rows
check_layout
expect_not "Second use of widget ID"
